  "description": [
    "32 pages : 21 cm",
    "Check out the recipes of Cool Best-Ever Brunches. It gives young readers fun new recipes and ideas to explore. This book has kid-tested recipes and includes lots of tips and tricks that make it easy to become an experienced kid cook. With photos of basic techniques, tools, and ingredients, this book will appeal to new cooks too",
    "Ages 8 to 12",
    "Includes index",
    "Plan a perfect party! -- What's the big idea? -- First things first -- Key symbols -- Uniquely cool -- Night before egg bake -- Cheesy vegetarian strata -- Chorizo breakfast bake -- Fruit salad four fun ways -- Caramel French toast -- Blueberry crumb cake -- Sour cream coffee cake -- Coolest bagels & spreads -- Bunch of brunch punches"
  ],
